  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Occupied Palestinian Territory 2012 CAP Diakonia  International Humanitarian law programme - OPT 2012 CAP Diakonia IHL</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d via FN:s humanit&#xe4;ra appell f&#xf6;r 2012 f&#xf6;r      Diakonias program f&#xf6;r internationell humanit&#xe4;r    r&#xe4;tt</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;det till Diakonia syftar till att  respekten f&#xf6;r folkr&#xe4;tten,       inklusive internationell humanit&#xe4;r r&#xe4;tt (IHL) och m&#xe4;nskliga           r&#xe4;ttigheter, &#xf6;kar i  oPt och Israel och att internationell humanit&#xe4;r  r&#xe4;tt b&#xe4;ttre integreras i humanit&#xe4;ra insatser.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The support to Diakonia aims to that Respect for international law,   including international humanitarian law (IHL) and human rights law,  is increased in the oPt and Israel and IHL is better integrated into  the humanitarian response.</narrative>
  </description>
